    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to Magnum Opus</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a non commercial online RPG designed for people looking to roleplay on its purest form. The world is a sandbox with lots of premade characters you can choose from, there are no set objectives or scripted quests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can choose to be all sorts of different characters, including characters that would be unplayable NPCs in other games, you can even roleplay as the final boss in a dungeon.<br><br> For example you could be a giant, a wild animal, a demon, a farm animal, a knight, an angel or a legendary hero.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game is designed to support up to 2700 different character archetypes, each with their own backstory and abilities. Of course populating the game with such a large character roster will take time, which is why the game is currently on Alpha stage and only accesible to Alpha testers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Magnum Opus the world is a stage and the players are the actors!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to Magnum Opus</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a non commercial online RPG designed for people looking to roleplay on its purest form. The world is a sandbox with lots of premade characters you can choose from, there are no set objectives or scripted quests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can choose to be all sorts of different characters, including characters that would be unplayable NPCs in other games, you can even roleplay as the final boss in a dungeon.<br><br> For example you could be a giant, a wild animal, a demon, a farm animal, a knight, an angel or a legendary hero.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game is designed to support up to 2700 different character archetypes, each with their own backstory and abilities. Of course populating the game with such a large character roster will take time, which is why the game is currently on Alpha stage and only accesible to Alpha testers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Magnum Opus the world is a stage and the players are the actors!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
    "short_description": "Join Magnum Opus the online sandbox roleplaying game and have fun with friends from all around the world! In Magnum Opus the world is a stage and players are the actors.",
